{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53511","headline":"秪（疑当作「抵」）剡 · 韦处厚","name":"秪（疑当作「抵」）剡","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋渚涵容碧，秋水刷眼青。\n排头烟树老，扑面水风腥。\n上濑复下濑，长亭仍短亭。\n夜船明月好，客梦满流萤。\n（《记纂渊海》卷九）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦处厚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53511.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53511","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}